---
// Clean component structure
---
<section class="spotlight-section" id="reports">
  <div class="spotlight-container">
    
    <div class="report-preview-side">
      <div class="report-card-mockup">
        <div class="report-tag">Forthcoming Intelligence</div>
        <div class="report-meta">Industrial Report • Q3 2026</div>
        <h3 class="report-mock-title">The Space Data Relay Market</h3>
        <p class="report-mock-subtitle">Global Architecture, Infrastructure Mapping & Commercial Ecosystem Dynamics</p>
        <div class="report-mock-logo">NEBULINK</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="report-details-side">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <div class="eyebrow-line"></div>
        <span class="eyebrow-span">Featured Market Intelligence</span>
      </div>
      
      <h2 class="section-title">Mapping the future of <span>orbital connectivity</span></h2>
      
      <p class="section-desc">
        As low-Earth orbit constellations scale exponentially, traditional ground station networks face critical latency bottlenecks. This comprehensive technical and commercial report maps the emerging space-to-space data relay architecture, profiling key operators, optical inter-satellite link (OISL) adoption, and sovereign data relay infrastructure.
      </p>

      <div class="key-pillars">
        <div class="pillar">
          <strong>Ecosystem Mapping</strong>
          <p>Granular profiles of commercial and institutional relay network architectures.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillar">
          <strong>Spectrum & Dynamics</strong>
          <p>Analysis of RF constraints and the transition to high-throughput laser communication.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="access-box">
        <h4>Request Executive Summary & Launch Updates</h4>
        <div class="access-form">
          <input type="email" placeholder="Institutional email address" />
          <button type="button">Inquire for Access ↗</button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.spotlight-section { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding: 60px 60px 120px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, var(--bg2) 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2); }  .spotlight-container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center; }
  .report-preview-side { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .report-card-mockup { width: 100%; max-width: 380px; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.4; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #043632 0%, var(--bg3) 100%); border: 1px solid var(--gold); padding: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); }
  .report-card-mockup::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border: 1px solid rgba(184,152,42,0.2); margin: 6px; pointer-events: none; }
  .report-tag { align-self: flex-start; font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); border: 1px solid var(--gold3); padding: 4px 10px; }
  .report-meta { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-top: auto; }
  .report-mock-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text); margin: 12px 0 8px; }
  .report-mock-subtitle { font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: auto; }
  .report-mock-logo { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.9rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: var(--gold3); }
  .eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .eyebrow-line { width: 24px; height: 1px; background: var(--gold); }
  .eyebrow-span { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); }
  .section-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .section-title span { font-style: italic; color: var(--gold); font-weight: 400; }
  .section-desc { font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .key-pillars { display: flex; gap: 32px; margin-bottom: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border2); padding-top: 30px; }
  .pillar { flex: 1; }
  .pillar strong { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .pillar p { font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); }
  .access-box { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border2); padding: 24px; }
  .access-box h4 { font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .access-form { display: flex; gap: 12px; }
  .access-form input { flex: 1; background: var(--bg2); border: 1px solid var(--border2); padding: 12px 16px; color: var(--text); font-family: 'Barlow', sans-serif; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .access-form input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--gold3); }
  .access-form button { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--gold3); color: var(--gold); font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 12px 24px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .access-form button:hover { background: var(--gold); color: var(--bg); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .spotlight-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 50px; } .key-pillars { flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
